<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (Americans and Canadians can enter Spain visa-free for up to 90 days within any 180-day period, like UK citizens. For longer stays, the NLV is the standard route for retirees. A growing number of US citizens are choosing Spain over traditional retirement destinations like Florida or Mexico, drawn by healthcare quality, walkable cities and the relative strength of the dollar against the euro. Spanish consulates in New York, Miami, Los Angeles and San Francisco have seen NLV applications from American retirees rise sharply since 2020.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
