/E (Apartments break. Boilers fail in January precisely when you need them. The wifi router needs replacing. A neighbour's leaking pipe is suddenly your leaking ceiling. None of this is dramatic if there is someone on the coast who can be at the property within two hours, speaks both your language and the plumber's, and knows which technician will come out on a Saturday in February. Without that, a small fault becomes a long week.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
