<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (We are not a concierge in the hotel sense. We are something closer to a well-connected neighbour who happens to also speak your language. We work with a deliberately small portfolio, and an equivalent number of guests each winter. Enough to know each apartment by heart and each guest by name. If anything in this guide raises a question that applies specifically to your situation, we offer a 20-minute call, free of charge, to talk it through. There is no follow-up sequence and no commitment of any kind. If we can help, we'll say so. If we can't, we'll point you toward who can.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
